   "evidence": "The temporary script registers the synthetic credential 'FAIL xy' and compares extracted base modules with head. Base applies 'redactCredentials(text).trim().slice(0, 500)' to the selected line alone. Head instead calls 'redactCredentials(text.slice(start, to + padding), { start: from - start, end: to - start })'. The redactor still requires 'substring || text === secret'; surrounding context defeats equality for short credentials. recordCiFailure inserts f.signature and f.line directly. The later commit adds independent redaction in bounded() and per-line redaction of the excerpt."
  },
  "B": {
